    {
        "id": "09b53c20cd4df9b4",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "677299ac2cab0b37",
        "name": "Flow to set 'Stay on' mode in sensor type 108 - Machine Uptime Monitoring Sensor \\n \\n Step 1) Double click on the Wireless Gateway node and select the 'dev/ttymxc2' from Serial Device Drop-down.\\n Step 2) Click on the Done and Deploy button.\\n Step 3) Press and release the Reset button on the sensor.\\n Step 4) Wait for FLY messge (configuration mode).\\n Step 5) You will see the command message.\\n Step 6) Once you configured your device, you can disable this flow.",
